docs {
  # MeetingsService.ListAppointments

  Psychology appointments with the student of a case (psychology only)

  `/ltedu.meetings.v1.MeetingsService/ListAppointments` · unary · `ltedu/meetings/v1/meetings.proto`

  ## Request — `ListAppointmentsRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `case_id` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `ListAppointmentsResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `appointments` | `repeated Appointment` |  |
  | `platform_available` | `bool` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Appointment`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `case_id` | `string` |  |
  | `student_id` | `string` |  |
  | `student_name` | `string` |  |
  | `scheduled_at` | `string` |  |
  | `duration_min` | `int32` |  |
  | `mode` | `string` | virtual \| in_person |
  | `provider` | `string` |  |
  | `link` | `string` |  |
  | `status` | `string` |  |
  | `created_name` | `string` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
